CONCLUSION

The EduHub project has successfully achieved all stated objectives and demonstrated significant positive impact on educational outcomes, validating the effectiveness of the implemented solution and providing a solid foundation for future enhancements and wider deployment.

Key achievements include:
- Successful development of a comprehensive mobile learning management system
- Significant improvements in student engagement and learning outcomes
- Effective integration of modern technologies in educational context
- Creation of a culturally and linguistically appropriate platform for Cambodian users

The project contributes valuable insights into educational technology development in developing contexts and provides a model for similar initiatives in other regions. Future work should focus on AI integration, expanded language support, and enhanced accessibility features.

